==Battleground==
*The base HP starts at 30,000, increases to 60,000, then 100,000. After that, it increases by 50,000 with each stage.
*10 [[Croco]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ranma Saotome (M) (Enemy)|Ranma Saotome (M)]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Ryoga Hibiki (Enemy)|Ryoga Hibiki]] spawns.
**1 [[Akane Tendo (Enemy)|Akane Tendo]] spawns.
**2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

