==Strategy==
Beyond level 10, bursting down Ranma Saotome (M) is essential, otherwise their backliners will destroy your backline. If you have enough [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rushers]] you should be able to knock him back once or twice before all the main collab bosses all appear. [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shield]] units like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] can be helpful, but lower-ranged ones are susceptible to be hit by Akane Tendo.

